><a href=\"Algodiff/index.html#type-t\">Algodiff.t</a> array</span> array</span>)</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span>(<span><a href=\"Algodiff/index.html#type-t\">Algodiff.t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><span><a href=\"Algodiff/index.html#type-t\">Algodiff.t</a> array</span> array</span> * <span><span><a href=\"Algodiff/index.html#type-t\">Algodiff.t</a> array</span> array</span>)</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span>(<span><span><span><a href=\"Algodiff/index.html#type-t\">Algodiff.t</a> array</span> array</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> unit)</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span>(<span>string <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> unit)</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><a href=\"Algodiff/index.html#type-t\">Algodiff.t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><a href=\"Algodiff/index.html#type-t\">Algodiff.t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <a href=\"Checkpoint/index.html#type-state\">Checkpoint.state</a></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>This function is specifically designed for minimising the weights in a neural network of graph structure. In Owl's earlier versions, the functions in the regression module were actually implemented using this function.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-minimise_fun\"><a href=\"#val-minimise_fun\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> minimise_fun : \u000A  <span><span class=\"optlabel\">?state</span>:<a href=\"Checkpoint/index.html#type-state\">Checkpoint.state</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><a href=\"Params/index.html#type-typ\">Params.typ</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span>(<span><a href=\"Algodiff/index.html#type-t\">Algodiff.t</a> <spa